xmode=abs_centre
layer=com_154
textfont=graphic_20452
fontmono=no
text=YMCA is the oldest and largest youth charity in the world.<br><br>It focuses on young people, helping them to play an active and fulfilling role within their communities.<br><br>They also provide a wide range of community-based activities and services to help meet local needs.
