xmode=abs_centre
layer=com_157
textfont=graphic_20452
fontmono=no
text=CPSL Mind won't give up until everyone experiencing a mental health problem gets both support and respect.<br><br>They provide advice and support to empower anyone experiencing a mental health problem.<br><br>They campaign to improve services, raise awareness and promote understanding.
